{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each level, you will receive some props, which you can place on your spaceship.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877430/extras/cf9fa7cdb4cfe7965ebb0e839a84910f.poster.avif?t=1753334482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877430/extras/cf9fa7cdb4cfe7965ebb0e839a84910f.webm?t=1753334482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877430/extras/cf9fa7cdb4cfe7965ebb0e839a84910f.mp4?t=1753334482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on where they are placed, your weapons and spaceship attributes will undergo different changes.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877430/extras/238626bd27b73410bffdd8c4d2308633.poster.avif?t=1753334482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877430/extras/238626bd27b73410bffdd8c4d2308633.webm?t=1753334482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877430/extras/238626bd27b73410bffdd8c4d2308633.mp4?t=1753334482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877430/extras/c3afe4d3e124cb0c97e22fe3b13b469a.poster.avif?t=1753334482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877430/extras/c3afe4d3e124cb0c97e22fe3b13b469a.webm?t=1753334482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877430/extras/c3afe4d3e124cb0c97e22fe3